ors.html?authorName=Porta%2C%20Marcello\u0022\u003EMarcello Porta\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Schlein%2C%20Benjamin\u0022\u003EBenjamin Schlein\u003C/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Seiringer%2C%20Robert\u0022\u003ERobert Seiringer\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003ECorrelation energy of a weakly interacting Fermi gas with large interaction potential\u003C/em\u003E, Arch. Ration. Mech. Anal. \u003Cstrong\u003E247\u003C/strong\u003E (2023), no.\u0026nbsp;4, Paper No. 65, 57.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=4614018\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E4614018\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1007/s00205-023-01893-6\u0022\u003E10.1007/s00205-023-01893-6\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bogolubov%2C%20N.\u0022\u003EN. Bogolubov\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EOn the theory of superfluidity\u003C/em\u003E, Acad. Sci. USSR. J. Phys. \u003Cstrong\u003E11\u003C/strong\u003E (1947), 23\u0026ndash;32.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=22177\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E22177\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Bohm%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Bohm\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Pines%2C%20David\u0022\u003EDavid Pines\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA collective description of electron interactions. I. Magnetic interactions\u003C/em\u003E, Phys. Rev. (2) \u003Cstrong\u003E82\u003C/strong\u003E (1951), 625\u0026ndash;634.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=41712\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E41712\u003C/strong\