<p>The editorial office for Journal of the American Mathematical Society can be contacted by <a href="https://www.ams.org/cgi-bin/fmail/fmail.cgi?emailto=52616e646f6d495698fba2f45b280d480a2f95772d2e866f8fccedf3286de5cfeefa0bf9c8be5ea2&amp;name=Journal of the American Mathematical Society &amp;subject=Contact:%Journal of the American Mathematical Society" target="_blank">email</a> or by postal mail to the Electronic PrePress Department, American Mathematical Society, 201 Charles Street, Providence, RI 02904-2213 USA.</p>

